            "message": {
              "role": "assistant",
              "content": "<toolPlan>\n  <stateChangeRequired>yes</stateChangeRequired>\n  <directUpdates>\n    <update>\n      <objectType>location</objectType>\n      <objectId></objectId>\n      <objectName>QA Offscreen Depot</objectName>\n      <field>description</field>\n      <valueJson>\"A sprawling, semi-permanent storage yard tucked behind the main tram line. The depot is a chaotic sea of stacked crates, tarped goods, and rusted forklifts waiting for parts. The air smells of diesel, damp wool, and old tea. It serves as the logistical throat of the region, where supplies move between the rural communities and the wider trade network.\n\nThe ground is a mix of packed dirt and gravel, slick with oil in the corners. Fencing separates the active loading zones from the long-term storage racks. It is a place of constant motion, noise, and minor accidents, far removed from the quiet dignity of the town square.\n\nThe depot marker bears one fresh blue QA stripe.\"</valueJson>\n    </update>\n  </directUpdates>\n  <otherTools/>\n</toolPlan>"
            }
          }
        ]
